    "text": "<p>Equation of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> normal vector to plane <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo></math><br />If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is parallel to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mro